{
  "cues": [
    {
      "id": "caption-001",
      "shotId": "shot-01",
      "text": "等等，我的意思是……",
      "speaker": "researcher",
      "fromFrame": 30,
      "toFrameExclusive": 120,
      "audioSeconds": 2.834,
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "rate": 0.98
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-002",
      "shotId": "shot-02",
      "text": "一个想法，抵达另一个人，需要多久？",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "fromFrame": 195,
      "toFrameExclusive": 304,
      "audioSeconds": 3.481792,
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "rate": 0.98
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-003",
      "shotId": "shot-03",
      "text": "每个人心里，都有一个难以完整说出的世界。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "fromFrame": 381,
      "toFrameExclusive": 498,
      "audioSeconds": 3.724708,
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "rate": 0.98
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-004",
      "shotId": "shot-04",
      "text": "我们把它变成语言、图像、公式。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "fromFrame": 624,
      "toFrameExclusive": 736,
      "audioSeconds": 3.56275,
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "rate": 0.98
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-005",
      "shotId": "shot-05",
      "text": "再由另一个人，一点一点，重新搭起。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "fromFrame": 855,
      "toFrameExclusive": 967,
      "audioSeconds": 3.56275,
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "rate": 0.98
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-006",
      "shotId": "shot-06",
      "text": "我们就这样，把无数孤岛连成文明。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "fromFrame": 1065,
      "toFrameExclusive": 1174,
      "audioSeconds": 3.481792,
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "rate": 0.98
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-007",
      "shotId": "shot-07",
      "text": "但如果，协作不必一次次从解释开始？",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "fromFrame": 1275,
      "toFrameExclusive": 1392,
      "audioSeconds": 3.724708,
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "rate": 0.98
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-008",
      "shotId": "shot-08",
      "text": "如果，同一个问题，可以向一万个方向，同时展开？",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "fromFrame": 1515,
      "toFrameExclusive": 1661,
      "audioSeconds": 4.696375,
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "rate": 0.98
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-009",
      "shotId": "shot-09",
      "text": "它让不同分身，走向不同的可能。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "fromFrame": 1821,
      "toFrameExclusive": 1906,
      "audioSeconds": 2.672083,
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "rate": 0.98
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-010",
      "shotId": "shot-10",
      "text": "有的提出构想，有的寻找反例。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "fromFrame": 2055,
      "toFrameExclusive": 2162,
      "audioSeconds": 3.400792,
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "rate": 0.98
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-011",
      "shotId": "shot-11",
      "text": "有的重新检查，所有人默认正确的前提。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "fromFrame": 2298,
      "toFrameExclusive": 2417,
      "audioSeconds": 3.805667,
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "rate": 0.98
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-012",
      "shotId": "shot-12",
      "text": "它们共享的不只是结论。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "fromFrame": 2574,
      "toFrameExclusive": 2642,
      "audioSeconds": 2.10525,
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "rate": 0.98
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-013",
      "shotId": "shot-13",
      "text": "还有假设、证据，以及别人可以接着推进的工作。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "fromFrame": 2805,
      "toFrameExclusive": 2953,
      "audioSeconds": 4.777333,
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "rate": 0.98
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-014",
      "shotId": "shot-14",
      "text": "但一万次赞同，也可能是同一个错误。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "fromFrame": 3045,
      "toFrameExclusive": 3152,
      "audioSeconds": 3.400792,
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "rate": 0.98
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-015",
      "shotId": "shot-15",
      "text": "直到，一个分身找到反例。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "fromFrame": 3315,
      "toFrameExclusive": 3383,
      "audioSeconds": 2.10525,
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "rate": 0.98
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-016",
      "shotId": "shot-16",
      "text": "它没有把错误藏起来。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "fromFrame": 3576,
      "toFrameExclusive": 3632,
      "audioSeconds": 1.700417,
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "rate": 0.98
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-017",
      "shotId": "shot-17",
      "text": "相关的推理被重新检查。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "fromFrame": 3906,
      "toFrameExclusive": 3984,
      "audioSeconds": 2.429167,
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "rate": 0.98
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-018",
      "shotId": "shot-17",
      "text": "整片星云，改变方向。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "fromFrame": 3992,
      "toFrameExclusive": 4065,
      "audioSeconds": 2.267208,
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "rate": 0.98
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-019",
      "shotId": "shot-18",
      "text": "失败没有消失。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "fromFrame": 4098,
      "toFrameExclusive": 4156,
      "audioSeconds": 1.781375,
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "rate": 0.98
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-020",
      "shotId": "shot-18",
      "text": "它成为其他路径的边界。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "fromFrame": 4178,
      "toFrameExclusive": 4253,
      "audioSeconds": 2.348167,
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "rate": 0.98
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-021",
      "shotId": "shot-19",
      "text": "不是所有声音变成一种声音。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "fromFrame": 4365,
      "toFrameExclusive": 4438,
      "audioSeconds": 2.267208,
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "rate": 0.98
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-022",
      "shotId": "shot-20",
      "text": "而是不同的探索，终于能够接成下一步。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "fromFrame": 4596,
      "toFrameExclusive": 4701,
      "audioSeconds": 3.319833,
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "rate": 0.98
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-023",
      "shotId": "shot-22",
      "text": "……这个前提，也许得重新检查。",
      "speaker": "researcher",
      "fromFrame": 4962,
      "toFrameExclusive": 5057,
      "audioSeconds": 2.995958,
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "rate": 0.98
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-024",
      "shotId": "shot-23",
      "text": "你听见的，只有一个声音。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "fromFrame": 5136,
      "toFrameExclusive": 5211,
      "audioSeconds": 2.348167,
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "rate": 0.98
    },
    {
      "id": "caption-025",
      "shotId": "shot-24",
      "text": "它背后，是一片同时思考的星空。",
      "speaker": "narrator",
      "fromFrame": 5280,
      "toFrameExclusive": 5387,
      "audioSeconds": 3.400792,
      "voice": "longtian_v3",
      "rate": 0.98
    }
  ],
  "durationSeconds": 180,
